    <title>DNSHE 免费域名申请和CF接入教程</title>
    <link href="https://blog.xiaomingclassmate.dpdns.org/posts/19677/"/>
    <id>https://blog.xiaomingclassmate.dpdns.org/posts/19677/</id>
    <published>2026-01-01T02:37:08.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-11-02T19:13:31.524Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231213135626.png" alt="image.png"><br>大家好，我是小明同学，今天给大家分享一个免费域名。</p><p>DNSHE 为全球开发者、学生和开源爱好者提供<strong>免费域名服务</strong>：<br>✓ 无需信用卡绑定<br>✓ 无隐藏费用<br>✓ 支持全类型 DNS 记录解析<br>✓ 即时上线各类数字项目</p><p><strong>立即注册</strong><br><a href="https://my.dnshe.com/aff.php?aff=39159">https://my.dnshe.com/aff.php?aff=39159</a></p><p>• 初始额度：可注册 3 个域名<br>• 使用邀请码&nbsp;<strong>CRCA2F85BC</strong>&nbsp;额外获取 1 个注册名额</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231235711426.png" alt="image.png"></p><p><strong>开放注册后缀</strong><br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231213216648.png" alt="image.png"><br>✧&nbsp;<strong>.de5.net</strong><br>› 极简风格｜个人博客/开源项目首选<br>› 示例：<code>yourname.de5.net</code></p><p>✧&nbsp;<strong>.us.ci</strong><br>› 自动化场景｜SaaS服务/API端点适配<br>› 示例：<code>api-service.us.ci</code></p><p>✧&nbsp;<strong>.cc.cd</strong><br>› 创意设计｜品牌展示/作品集门户<br>› 示例：<code>studio-portfolio.cc.cd</code></p><p><strong>域名注册步骤</strong></p><p>1.注册账号后，进入”免费域名”页面<br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231214113843.png" alt="image.png"> 2.选择根域名，输入域名前缀完成注册<br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231214420540.png" alt="image.png"></p><p><strong>Cloudflare接入指南</strong><br><em>(目前仅支持 .de5.net 后缀)</em></p><p>1.登录 Cloudflare，点击&nbsp;<strong>加入域</strong><br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231215438258.png" alt="image.png"> 2.输入域名 → 选择 Free 套餐 →&nbsp;<strong>继续前往激活</strong><br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231215540291.png" alt="image.png"><br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231215738269.png" alt="image.png"><br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231215910021.png" alt="image.png"> 3.复制分配的 NS 服务器地址<br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231220031348.png" alt="image.png"> 4.返回 DNSHE → 目标域名&nbsp;<strong>DNS服务器</strong><br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231214552102.png" alt="image.png"> 5.粘贴地址（每行一个）→&nbsp;<strong>一键替换</strong><br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231220316932.png" alt="image.png"></p><p>6.待状态显示&nbsp;<strong>活动</strong>&nbsp;即完成<br><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jumplooper/images/image/20251231221121883.png" alt="image.png"></p><p><strong>注意事项</strong></p><ol><li>️❗&nbsp;<strong>免费域名禁止用于生产环境或核心服务</strong></li><li>严格遵守使用规范，杜绝违法违规行为</li></ol><p><strong>最后</strong></p><p>立即开启您的免费域名之旅，探索数字世界无限可能！</p><p>好了，以上就是今天给大家分享的内容，我是爱分享的小明同学，如果今天的内容对你有帮助请记得收藏，顺便点点关注，咱们下期再见！谢谢大家~</p><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/spoiler.css" type="text/css"><script src="/js/spoiler.js" type="text/javascript" async></script>]]></content>
    
    
